{
  "_readme": [
    "Owner-authored settlement rules. Server and client both read this file; restart the server and reload the client after editing.",
    "Bands count up from the shore: band 0 is the first dry band, band 63 the highest.",
    "buildings: every building the game can draw. tier ranks model complexity (0 straw and hide ... 10 landmark); other plugins read it (boats need tier 1, skiffs, wind damage).",
    "categories: checked in this order; the first whose site and bands match a settlement's anchor cell owns it.",
    "  site: coastal (sea within 4 world units), inland (no sea there), or any.",
    "  chain: the upgrade path. A building upgrades into the entry after it; the last entry does not upgrade.",
    "  landmarks: rare buildings that may replace a settlement that has finished its chain.",
    "landmarks: the bands each landmark may stand on, and the closest two of the same kind may stand, in world units."
  ],
